- =autolisp-runtime/tests/multidocument-conformance-tests.lisp= (new, 5 tests,
  =autolisp-runtime-suite=):
  - E1 symbol OBJECT is process-global (=eq= of the same interned name);
  - E1 per-document VALUE cells are independent (=document-namespace-set/-ref=);
  - E1 switching document switches the visible value (through the real
